-    $$
-    y = y_0 + j \cdot \frac{y_1 - y_0}{y\_ext - 1}
-    $$
-    $$
-    z = z_0 + k \cdot \frac{z_1 - z_0}{z\_ext - 1}
-    $$
-    [S1, G, unofficial]
